{"sha": "493493d514808d78047f3246a15edc0c53ddf4ae4d72fd8755ff9c279e7492c3", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:open-systems} 章 --- 热力学衡算与开口系统}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:1}", "(a) $\\qty{2e-4}{m^3/s}/\\qty{7.85e-5}{m^2} = \\qty{2.5}{m/s}$. (b) $(0.1 \\times 60 + 0.2", "\\times 10)/0.3 = \\qty{26.7}{\\celsius}$. (c) $\\dot S_{\\text{c}} = 0.1c\\ln(299.8/333) +", "0.2c\\ln(299.8/283) = \\qty{4.3}{W/K}$：热量从热水传向冷水。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:2}", "$\\sqrt{2 \\times 200 \\times 10^3 + 50^2} = \\qty{634}{m/s}$; $c^2/2c_p = \\qty{45}{K}$;", "\\qty{31}{K}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:3}", "(a) $T$ 不变，$s$ 增加 $r\\ln(P_1/P_2)$。(b) $h = \\qty{2576}{kJ/kg}$：", "$x = (2576 - 417)/2258 = 0.956$ --- 干度由", "出口处过热（或恰为干饱和）蒸气的温度读出。(c) $(256 -", "200)/199 = 0.28$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:4}", "(a) \\qty{41.8}{kW}; $41.8 \\times 10^3/(1005 \\times 20) = \\qty{2.1}{kg/s}$, \\qty{1.7}{m^3/s}.", "(b) \\qty{10}{MW}. (c) $v\\Delta P = \\qty{5.9}{kJ/kg}$; \\qty{3}{MW}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:5}", "(a) 由\\cref{thm:b2:open-systems:firstlaw}可知。(b) 流体被", "相邻流体推入和推出：该压强功（单位质量为 $Pv$）", "与 $u$ 合并计入。(c) \\qty{50}{J/kg} 和 \\qty{45}{kJ/kg}，相较于 \\qty{1}{kJ/kg}。", "(d) \\qty{981}{J/kg} 与 \\qty{4180}{J/kg} 相比：\\qty{0.23}{K}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:6}", "(a) \\qty{531}{K}, \\qty{239}{kJ/kg}. (b) \\qty{299}{kJ/kg}, \\qty{590}{K}, $c_p\\ln(590/531)", "= \\qty{106}{J/kg/K}$。(c) 每级在 \\qty{393}{K} 处结束：$2 \\times 1005 \\times 100 =", "\\qty{201}{kJ/kg}$，节省 $16\\%$。(d) $rT\\ln 8 = \\qty{175}{kJ/kg}$；若", "在多级之间进行级间冷却，则过程线紧贴等温线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:7}", "(a) $x = (6.88 - 0.476)/7.918 = 0.81$, $h_{4s} = \\qty{2098}{kJ/kg}$, $w_{\\text{s}} =", "\\qty{1324}{kJ/kg}$. (b) \\qty{1125}{kJ/kg}; $h_4 = 2297$, $x_4 = 0.89$. (c) $s_4 =", "\\qty{7.53}{kJ/kg/K}$：$s_{\\text{c}} = \\qty{0.65}{kJ/kg/K}$；损失 $T_0s_{\\text{c}} =", "\\qty{200}{kJ/kg}$。(d) 速度为数百米每秒的液滴侵蚀", "末级叶片。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:8}", "(a) $h_2 = 399 + 27/0.8 = \\qty{433}{kJ/kg}$；$w = \\qty{34}{kJ/kg}$。(b) $q_{\\text{evap}}", "= 143$，$q_{\\text{cond}} = \\qty{177}{kJ/kg}$；$\\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{c}} = 4.2$，", "$\\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{h}} = 5.2$。(c) $6.8$ 和 $7.8$；三分之二。(d) \\qty{0.045}{kg/s}，", "\\qty{1.5}{kW}；蒸发器温度越低，意味着压强越低、", "压力比越大（每千克做功更多），且蒸气更轻（", "每冲程质量更少）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:9}", "(a) \\qty{30}{\\celsius}. (b) $4180[\\ln(323/363) + 2\\ln(303/283)] = \\qty{83}{W/K}$.", "(c) \\qty{24}{kW}，占 \\qty{167}{kW}。(d) 并流时温差", "更大，且热流体出口温度不能低于冷流体出口温度：", "相同负荷下产生的熵更多。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:10}", "(a) $\\dd(mu)/\\dd t = \\dot m h_0$ 积分得 $mu = mh_0$：$c_vT = c_pT_0$，", "$T = \\gamma T_0$。(b) \\qty{410}{K}。(c) 终态气体是原有气体（温度为 $T_0$）", "与被加热至 $\\gamma T_0$ 的流入气体的混合物，因而", "介于二者之间。(d) 流动功使气体升温；缓慢充入", "水浴可将热量导出，使 \\qty{20}{\\celsius} 时的压强", "恰为所需。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:11}", "(a) $x = (7.76 - 0.476)/7.918 = 0.92$, $h = \\qty{2367}{kJ/kg}$. (b) $w = 572 + 1111", "- 6 = \\qty{1677}{kJ/kg}$, $q = 3278 + 628 = \\qty{3906}{kJ/kg}$, $\\eta = 0.43$", "与 $0.40$ 相比。(c) 再热在高温下加入热量，并", "提高了吸热的平均温度。(d) 排气更干燥", "（$0.92$，而非 $0.81$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:open-systems:12}", "(a) \\qty{293}{K}, \\qty{596}{K}, \\qty{1500}{K}, \\qty{737}{K}. (b) $w_{\\text{c}} = 305$,", "$w_{\\text{t}} = 767$, $q = \\qty{909}{kJ/kg}$, $\\eta = 0.51 = 1 - 12^{-0.286}$. (c)", "排气热量高于 \\qty{373}{K}：\\qty{366}{kJ/kg}；$0.7 \\times 0.35 \\times 366 =", "\\qty{90}{kJ/kg}$：$\\eta = (462 + 90)/909 = 0.61$。(d) 它在", "\\qty{1500}{K} 处吸热，并在 \\qty{306}{K} 处放热：", "这是任何工质所允许的最大温度跨度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:open-systems:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 压缩机（绝热，$w = \\Delta h$），冷凝器（等压，", "放热），节流阀（等焓），蒸发器（等压，吸热）。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $h_4 = \\qty{256}{kJ/kg}$, $x_4 = 0.28$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} \\qty{143}{kJ/kg}.", "", "\\textbf{4.} \\qty{27}{} 与 \\qty{34}{kJ/kg}；$h_2 = 433$；$T_2 \\approx 45 + 7 \\approx", "\\qty{52}{\\celsius}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} \\qty{177}{kJ/kg}; $\\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{h}} = 5.2$, $\\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{c}} = 4.2$;", "$5.2 = 4.2 + 1$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} $7.8$ 与 $6.8$；三分之二。", "", "\\textbf{7.} \\qty{0.045}{kg/s}；\\qty{1.5}{kW}，在插头处为 \\qty{1.7}{kW}。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 压缩机：$c_p\\ln(325/318) \\approx \\qty{0.022}{kJ/kg/K}$；", "节流阀：$s_4 - s_3 = 1.204 - 1.19 = \\qty{0.014}{kJ/kg/K}$ --- 压缩机的更大。", ""]}